nt,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI开源Codex Security CLI工具，支持CI/CD流水线自动化漏洞扫描</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI发布GPT-Live-Transcribe与GPT-Transcribe两款转录模型</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI与Anthropic等公司1100名员工联名上书呼吁放缓AI开发</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果系统更新首次在CVE致谢名单中点名Claude、Codex等AI模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ab0a74465a917d7a3767fccffcbaac4e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果在最新发布的iOS、iPadOS、watchOS、tvOS、visionOS及macOS Tahoe系统更新中，首次在官方CVE漏洞归因列表中明确提及AI模型。此次修复的大量安全漏洞中，Anthropic的Claude模型与OpenAI的Codex Security各协助发现3项漏洞，NVIDIA AI红队贡献2项，Z.ai的GLM模型协助修复1项。研究人员Milad Nasr与Nicholas Carlini利用Claude成功修复了WebKit、WebKit Storage及WebDAV等关键模块漏洞。此次行动得益于Anthropic今年4月发起的1亿美元“Glasswing计划”，该计划联合苹果、微软、Google等巨头，通过专用Claude Mythos Preview模型在漏洞被利用前进行预警与修</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">摩尔线程MTT S5000智算卡完成适配，成功拉起2.8万亿参数Kimi K3模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/66eb33fc0b7a17b95d2eb21bbdc1c39a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">摩尔线程宣布，其自研的MTT S5000智算卡及MUSA软件栈已完成对月之暗面开源的2.8万亿参数大模型Kimi K3的适配与稳定运行。此次适配标志着国产GPU在处理超大规模参数模型方面取得重要进展。MTT S5000作为摩尔线程主打训练与推理一体的智算硬件，通过MUSA软件栈的底层翻译与优化，成功承载了Kimi K3的权重运行。这一技术突破证明了国产算力底座已具备支撑万亿级参数模型的能力，为开发者提供了更多元的国产化算力选择。随着国产芯片对超大规模开源模型的适配能力不断提升，国产大模型算力生态版图正持续完善，进一步降低了高性能AI模型的部署门槛。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI开源Codex Security CLI工具，支持CI/CD流水线自动化漏洞扫描</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/730c66fd8008a8495148a3d15a35b002.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI于7月29日正式开源命令行工具Codex Security CLI，旨在帮助开发者在CI/CD流水线中实现代码仓库的安全漏洞扫描与验证。该工具目前处于早期版本，支持通过npm安装（@openai/codex-security），并提供TypeScript SDK接口供开发者集成。在运行环境方面，需配置Node.js 22及以上版本与Python 3.10及以上版本。认证方式灵活，支持ChatGPT账号登录或通过设置OPENAI_API_KEY环境变量进行API密钥验证，适用于CI环境的自动化部署。开发者可通过npx命令执行扫描，工具会自动追踪跨运行周期的安全问题，并将扫描记录存入指定工作目录。该工具的开源将安全检查前移至代码合入阶段，显著提升了软件供应链的自动化防御能力，目前代码已托管至GitHub</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI发布GPT-Live-Transcribe与GPT-Transcribe两款转录模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/582a5a22738f6362a99e79de2688fac9.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI于7月29日正式通过API发布GPT-Live-Transcribe与GPT-Transcribe两款全新转录模型。GPT-Live-Transcribe主打低延迟实时转录，定价为每分钟0.017美元；GPT-Transcribe则针对批量异步任务优化，定价为每分钟0.0045美元。新模型核心优势在于Context Aware ASR能力，在接入上下文后语义准确率显著提升。性能方面，GPT-Transcribe在Common Voice的22种语言测试中，将转录错误率降至19.27%，相比Whisper（whisper-1）的40.37%错误率，性能提升超过一倍；在真实世界录音的九种语言基准测试中，其错误率仅为8.98%，远优于Whisper的15.21%。该系列模型通过增强对口音、专业术语及背景噪</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI与Anthropic等公司1100名员工联名上书呼吁放缓AI开发</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d01e484e57136c613ef0137fafac685d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">来自OpenAI、Anthropic、谷歌和Meta等头部AI公司的1100多名员工联合签署公开信，呼吁美国政府介入并控制AI发展速度。此次名为“把控前沿”的倡议，核心聚焦于“自动化AI开发”，即AI系统具备递归式自我改进能力所带来的潜在风险。签署者包括Anthropic CEO达里奥·阿莫代伊、OpenAI首席科学家雅库布·帕霍茨基及Meta首席科学家赵晟佳等行业核心人物。OpenAI CEO萨姆·奥尔特曼态度发生显著转变，从此前拒绝签署类似倡议转为公开支持，主张应让社会有时间适应新能力并建立防护机制。信中警告，AI能力发展速度可能超出人类控制范畴，呼吁政府支持国际合作，开发必要的技术与治理工具，以有意识地把控自动化AI开发的前沿进程。此举反映了AI行业对递归式自我改进技术安全风险的认知正在发生深刻变化。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
